  "criterion": "The complete authenticated Target119 async wrapper and core are admitted atomically. The proof binds every target-added owner residue, the wrapper request shape, the full core control-flow contract, the JSX consumer and module-initializer edge, and canonical preservation through Targets120 and 121. Historical autofix-pr source establishes the public owning boundary but omits the extracted request/core architecture, so no partial source replay is allowed.",
